From 700ebc87d64b6408c0c0b47f366867c3e91a9d7f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pulpoff <pashkovsky@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:37:28 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] dts: exynos9820: describe more of the SoC

Watchdog, USI/I2C/SPI/UART blocks, DisplayPort, the Wi-Fi PCIe
port, GPU, audio (ABOX and its SysMMU), camera CSIS, MFC and the
DECON display controller with their clocks, for the S10e devicetree.
